  "scientificQualification": {
    "entry": "The unchanged existing authoritative orientation introduces useful everyday, participation, study and career perspectives and asks what sparks curiosity or whether to continue. Its full German and English contract explicitly assumes and tests no subject knowledge. It has no requires, contains, examples, examData or forbidden assessment/memory tags; official native orientation-structure validation returns no findings.",
